<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Selamat Hari Ayah</title>
<style>
:root{
  --white:#fffdf8; --cream:#f5ead6; --cream2:#ecdcbc;
  --brown:#5a3a22; --brown2:#8a5a36; --amber:#c2751f;
  --w:min(340px,86vw,34vh); --h:calc(var(--w)*1.3);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,#fbf4e6,#efe0c4);
  font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:var(--brown);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;
}
.leaves{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
.leaf{position:absolute;top:-40px;opacity:.75;animation:fall linear infinite}
@keyframes fall{
  0%{transform:translateY(-40px) rotate(0) translateX(0)}
  50%{transform:translateY(55vh) rotate(180deg) translateX(30px)}
  100%{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg) translateX(-20px)}
}
.stage{perspective:1400px;transition:transform 1.2s ease}
.stage.open{transform:translateY(calc(var(--h)/2))}
.card{position:relative;width:var(--w);height:var(--h);transform-style:preserve-3d;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer;display:block;font:inherit;color:inherit}
.card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber);outline-offset:6px}
.inside,.face{border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(90,58,34,.22)}
.inside{
  position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--white),var(--cream));
  padding:10% 9%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:safe center;align-items:center;text-align:center;
  border:1px solid var(--cream2);
}
.inside p{font-size:clamp(10.5px,calc(var(--w)*.042),16px);line-height:1.6}
.inside p+p{margin-top:.7em}
.inside .sign{margin-top:1.2em;font-style:italic;color:var(--brown2)}
.rule{width:36px;height:1px;background:var(--amber);margin:0 auto .8em;opacity:.7}
.cover{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-origin:top center;transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform 1.3s cubic-bezier(.6,.05,.25,1);z-index:2}
.card.open .cover{transform:rotateX(180deg)}
.face{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--cream2)}
.front{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--cream),var(--cream2))}
.front::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:10px;border:1px solid rgba(90,58,34,.4);border-radius:3px}
.back{background:var(--white);transform:rotateX(180deg)}
.front h1{font-size:clamp(24px,calc(var(--w)*.105),40px);font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-top:.5em}
.front .date{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brown2);margin-top:.6em}
.front .hint{position:absolute;bottom:9%;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--brown2);animation:pulse 2.2s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.35}}
.back h2{font-size:clamp(22px,calc(var(--w)*.09),34px);font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;margin-top:.4em}
.cluster{width:46%;height:auto}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.leaf{animation:none}.cover,.stage{transition-duration:.01s}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="leaves" id="leaves" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="stage" id="stage">
  <button class="card" id="card" aria-label="Buka kartu ucapan Hari Ayah" aria-expanded="false">
    <div class="inside">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p>Hari ini aku mengingat bahwa ada seseorang yang kusebut ayah.</p>
      <p>Perjalananku tidak selalu mudah, dan aku tumbuh dengan caraku sendiri.</p>
      <p>Terima kasih untuk kehidupan yang kuterima. Semoga kamu sehat dan baik-baik saja.</p>
      <p class="sign">Dari anakmu</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cover">
      <div class="face front">
        <svg class="cluster" viewBox="0 0 120 90" fill="none">
          <g transform="translate(10 18) rotate(-25 20 25)"><path d="M20 2C8 10 4 24 10 38c6 4 10 2 10 2s4 2 10-2c6-14 2-28-10-36z" fill="#b5541a"/><path d="M20 4v46" stroke="#f5ead6" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
          <g transform="translate(46 4) rotate(10 20 25)"><path d="M20 2C8 10 4 24 10 38c6 4 10 2 10 2s4 2 10-2c6-14 2-28-10-36z" fill="#d98e2b"/><path d="M20 4v46" stroke="#f5ead6" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
          <g transform="translate(76 26) rotate(35 20 25)"><path d="M20 2C8 10 4 24 10 38c6 4 10 2 10 2s4 2 10-2c6-14 2-28-10-36z" fill="#8a4b22"/><path d="M20 4v46" stroke="#f5ead6" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
        </svg>
        <h1>Selamat<br>Hari Ayah</h1>
        <div class="date">12 November</div>
        <div class="hint">KETUK UNTUK MEMBUKA</div>
      </div>
      <div class="face back">
        <svg class="cluster" viewBox="0 0 120 90" fill="none" style="opacity:.85">
          <g transform="translate(20 14) rotate(20 20 25)"><path d="M20 2C8 10 4 24 10 38c6 4 10 2 10 2s4 2 10-2c6-14 2-28-10-36z" fill="#d98e2b"/><path d="M20 4v46" stroke="#fffdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
          <g transform="translate(62 20) rotate(-20 20 25)"><path d="M20 2C8 10 4 24 10 38c6 4 10 2 10 2s4 2 10-2c6-14 2-28-10-36z" fill="#b5541a"/><path d="M20 4v46" stroke="#fffdf8" stroke-width="1.5"/></g>
        </svg>
        <h2>Untuk Ayah</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
  </button>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var card=document.getElementById('card'),stage=document.getElementById('stage');
  card.addEventListener('click',function(){
    var open=card.classList.toggle('open');
    stage.classList.toggle('open',open);
    card.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open);
  });
  var colors=['#b5541a','#d98e2b','#8a4b22','#a0612a','#c9772e'],box=document.getElementById('leaves');
  for(var i=0;i<14;i++){
    var s=document.createElement('span');s.className='leaf';
    var size=14+Math.random()*14;
    s.style.left=Math.random()*100+'%';
    s.style.width=s.style.height=size+'px';
    s.style.animationDuration=(12+Math.random()*12)+'s';
    s.style.animationDelay=(-Math.random()*20)+'s';
    s.innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%"><path d="M12 2C6 6 3 12 6 19c3 2 6 1 6 1s3 1 6-1c3-7 0-13-6-17z" fill="'+colors[i%colors.length]+'"/></svg>';
    box.appendChild(s);
  }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
